The User is responsible for safeguarding license keys, activation information, delivery links, access links, installers, receipts, and other delivery or proof-of-purchase materials. Loss, deletion, exposure, forwarding, unauthorized disclosure, unauthorized use, or failure to retain such materials is the User's responsibility unless mandatory law provides otherwise.

