The Software is licensed, not sold. The User receives only a limited, personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, and revocable permission to use the Software within the scope expressly allowed by iisacc.

The User must not copy, reproduce, duplicate, clone, extract, mirror, upload, redistribute, resell, lend, lease, sublicense, publicly post, publicly transmit, or otherwise provide the Software or any part of it to any third party without iisacc's prior written consent. This prohibition applies to the Software itself, installers, updates, executable files, compressed archives, license keys, activation information, documentation, product assets, and any other copy or derivative copy of the Software.

